  "detail_text": "The purpose of this requirement is to procure myBaits® Custom 480K hybridization capture reagents equivalent to sixty-four (64) enrichment reactions (Rxns) to support targeted metagenomic sequencing for the detection and identification of arthropod contaminants in food products. This procurement is for reagents only; sequencing equipment and associated laboratory instrumentation are already available in the Wiley Building (CPK1).",
